@startuml
title E4 실행 상태·속도 (State) + E5 Undo/Redo (Command + Memento)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Swing UI" {
  class UniversePanel {
    ~installMenus()
  }
  class ClockPanel {
    -runHalt : JButton
    -speed : JSlider
    -state : JLabel
    -refresh()
  }
}

package "명령 (Command)" {
  interface Command {
    +execute()
  }
  class ClockCommands {
    +control() : ClockControl
    +getTick() : Command
    +getHalt() : Command
    +createRun(delay : int) : Command
    +changeSpeed(delay : int) : Command
    +runAgonizing() : Command
    +runSlow() : Command
    +runMedium() : Command
    +runFast() : Command
  }
  class GridCommands {
    +getUndo() : Command
    +getRedo() : Command
    +getClear() : Command
  }
  class TickCommand
  class RunCommand {
    -delay : int
  }
  class HaltCommand
  class UndoCommand
  class RedoCommand
  class ClearCommand
}

package "실행 상태 (State)" {
  class ClockControl <<Context>> {
    {static} +MIN_DELAY : int = 10
    {static} +MAX_DELAY : int = 500
    {static} +DEFAULT_DELAY : int = 150
    -state : ClockState
    -delay : int
    +run(delay : int)
    +halt()
    +changeSpeed(delay : int)
    +isRunning() : boolean
    +stateLabel() : String
    +delay() : int
    +addListener(listener : Runnable)
  }
  interface ClockState <<State>> {
    {static} HALTED : ClockState
    {static} RUNNING : ClockState
    +run(clock : ClockControl, delay : int)
    +halt(clock : ClockControl)
    +changeSpeed(clock : ClockControl, delay : int)
    +isRunning() : boolean
    +label() : String
  }
  class HaltedState <<ConcreteState>>
  class RunningState <<ConcreteState>>
  class Clock <<Singleton>> {
    {static} +instance() : Clock
    +startTicking(millisecondsBetweenTicks : int)
    +stop()
    +tick()
  }
}

package "Undo 기록 (Memento)" {
  class HistoryManager {
    {static} +MAX_HISTORY : int = 100
    {static} +saveState(model : UniverseModel)
    {static} +setIgnoreSave(ignore : boolean)
    {static} +isIgnoringSave() : boolean
    {static} +clearHistory()
    {static} +pushUndo(snapshot : UniverseSnapshot)
    {static} +pushRedo(snapshot : UniverseSnapshot)
    {static} +popUndo() : UniverseSnapshot
    {static} +popRedo() : UniverseSnapshot
  }
  class UniverseSnapshot <<Memento>> {
    -state : Storable
    -generation : long
  }
  class UniverseModel {
    ~createMemento() : Storable
    ~restore(state : Storable, generation : long)
    ~clear()
  }
}

UniversePanel ..> ClockCommands : Go 메뉴
UniversePanel ..> GridCommands : Grid 메뉴
ClockPanel ..> ClockCommands : 버튼·슬라이더 → execute()
ClockPanel ..> ClockControl : 상태 변경 알림 구독

TickCommand ..|> Command
RunCommand ..|> Command
HaltCommand ..|> Command
UndoCommand ..|> Command
RedoCommand ..|> Command
ClearCommand ..|> Command
ClockCommands *-- ClockControl
ClockCommands ..> RunCommand : 생성
RunCommand --> ClockControl : run(delay)
HaltCommand --> ClockControl : halt()
TickCommand ..> Clock : tick()

ClockControl --> ClockState : 현재 상태
HaltedState ..|> ClockState
RunningState ..|> ClockState
ClockControl ..> Clock : startTicking / stop
HaltedState ..> HistoryManager : Run 직전 1회 저장,\n저장 건너뛰기 On
RunningState ..> HistoryManager : 저장 건너뛰기 Off

GridCommands ..> UndoCommand : 생성
GridCommands ..> RedoCommand : 생성
GridCommands ..> ClearCommand : 생성
UndoCommand ..> HistoryManager
RedoCommand ..> HistoryManager
UndoCommand --> UniverseModel : restore()
RedoCommand --> UniverseModel : restore()
ClearCommand --> UniverseModel : clear()
HistoryManager o--> "0..100" UniverseSnapshot : undo / redo
UniverseModel ..> HistoryManager : 편집·tick·clear 전에 saveState()

note bottom of ClockControl
  정지 --Run--> 실행 중 (Undo 1단계 저장)
  실행 중 --Run/속도--> 실행 중 (속도만 변경)
  실행 중 --Halt--> 정지
  정지 --속도--> 정지 (속도만 기억)
end note

@enduml
